{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing Tamer: King of Dinosaurs - an action/adventure game for people of culture who love dinosaurs, adventure, and harem dating sims feauring beautiful alien women.\u00a0Complete quests, gather resources, and bond with your lovers while keeping your tribe safe on a deadly primitive world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/263a75ead1a84defe76fbe3153d8d06a.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e699d6ee26690597cc63d1c9a59e1567.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e699d6ee26690597cc63d1c9a59e1567.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/e699d6ee26690597cc63d1c9a59e1567.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique love interests await you in Tamer: King of Dinosaurs.\u00a0Since Tamer: King of Dinosaurs is a harem game, you won\u2019t have to worry about picking just one. All four women will fall in love with you as long as you complete the dating sim respect quests, and they do not have a problem sharing you with the others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve earned enough respect with each woman, you will be able to make love to them. You\u2019ll have complete control of the position, camera angle, lighting, and pace. Our proprietary full-body performance capture technology is brought to life by a talented cast of professional actors, so every romance scene, every conflict, and every triumph is rooted in the context of our story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/ff5bd7c898d55018ad9e134e290c19da.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/f012ee1f69595f10735ab20b1749f6df.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/f012ee1f69595f10735ab20b1749f6df.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/f012ee1f69595f10735ab20b1749f6df.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Victor Shelby, a Los Angeles animal control officer abducted by aliens and stranded on a deadly dinosaur planet where he must help a group of beautiful alien women survive. With nearly 6 hours of full-body cinematic performance capture and 28 &quot;days&quot; of in-game  action, <i>Tamer: King of Dinosaurs</i> offers a gripping story filled with adventure, an engaging story, and fully explicit romance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/145478d4d7d51e940c2a64bd65a56eb5.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a0fb406a19785412a0f539b16c644dd4.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a0fb406a19785412a0f539b16c644dd4.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a0fb406a19785412a0f539b16c644dd4.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and upgrade weapons like spears, clubs and axes to engage dinosaurs in brutal melee combat with your hunting partner, Sheela. Utilize the adrenaline system to unleash special attacks and even special over-the-top, gore-filled executions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/f657af0bb5827a61af10018c34fea23a.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/614efa79eb77e001c82ff17e4d8cbc76.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/614efa79eb77e001c82ff17e4d8cbc76.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/614efa79eb77e001c82ff17e4d8cbc76.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame dinosaurs and ride them across the map, encountering deadly apex predators and other dangerous dinosaurs that will hunt and chase you down. Don't just run - fight for your life with your spear, bow and arrows to escape certain death. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/bb2e31d2838b4d7bc43a200e6fc47cb8.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheela, the Huntress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stoic cat-like woman is skilled in combat and understands the dangers of this world. She\u2019ll join you on most of your quests, help you build weapons, and provide you with combat training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galmine, the Gardener.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This beautiful woman has the sweetest personality you could imagine, and she loves to grow her vegetables and herbs. She\u2019ll offer uplifting advice and provide you with recipes for food, potions, and anything else plant related.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trel-Idil-Iria, Duchess of Family Iria, the Builder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trel is the most important, intelligent, and beautiful person in her world, and she\u2019ll remind you of this every chance she gets. Despite her haughty personality, she really is a genius. Once you win her over, she\u2019ll help you craft tools and build the fort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kacerie, the Stylist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink haired and sassy, Kacerie comes from a world with slightly more advanced technology than our Earth. She doesn\u2019t want to be on this planet, but that\u2019s understandable. Once she forms a strong relationship with you, she\u2019ll be able to help you with all the cosmetic nuances of women\u2019s outfits and the new fort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are on track for a Q2 2026 launch. Check out our website for more updates, and don\u2019t forget to wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3026730?t=1771967172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/a5ce4ff0fb5c691321feb92109282e7d7a6912fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771967172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/4bd1e16aba26669894e6136a0e596d8e684ba3cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771967172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/4bd1e16aba26669894e6136a0e596d8e684ba3cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771967172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Tamer: King of Dinosaurs is a dinosaur themed adventure game with fort and relationship building. During the course of the game, the player will be able to romance four unique alien women.\r\n- Dialogue around love, sex, and procreating that may not be suitable for those under the age of 18.\r\n- Clothed kissing and hugging.\r\n- Skimpy and revealing outfits.\r\n- Consensual and explicit sex scenes where the player