u down. Don't just run - fight for your life with your spear, bow and arrows to escape certain death. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/bb2e31d2838b4d7bc43a200e6fc47cb8.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheela, the Huntress.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/a5cf741462ef7a8c15cce087e7546eb0.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This stoic cat-like woman is skilled in combat and understands the dangers of this world. She\u2019ll join you on most of your quests, help you build weapons, and provide you with combat training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galmine, the Gardener.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/2c341234a7c1f3ef0f218201d94364f4.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This beautiful woman has the sweetest personality you could imagine, and she loves to grow her vegetables and herbs. She\u2019ll offer uplifting advice and provide you with recipes for food, potions, and anything else plant related.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trel-Idil-Iria, Duchess of Family Iria, the Builder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/59dab511ffaed6babeb7c76b2ec6ab5b.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trel is the most important, intelligent, and beautiful person in her world, and she\u2019ll remind you of this every chance she gets. Despite her haughty personality, she really is a genius. Once you win her over, she\u2019ll help you craft tools and build the fort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kacerie, the Stylist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.poster.avif?t=1771967172\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.webm?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/extras/fbc671037ef180cfdc8952a5d64d6c68.mp4?t=1771967172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pink haired and sassy, Kacerie comes from a world with slightly more advanced technology than our Earth. She doesn\u2019t want to be on this planet, but that\u2019s understandable. Once she forms a strong relationship with you, she\u2019ll be able to help you with all the cosmetic nuances of women\u2019s outfits and the new fort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are on track for a Q2 2026 launch. Check out our website for more updates, and don\u2019t forget to wishlist!</p>","developers":["Ride the Lion Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3026730/3f2c17e39fe6729358df62bc4a0f1a261b879099/header.jpg?t=1771967172","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"TAMER KING OF DINOSAURS is a trademark authorized for use by Ride the Lion Studios. \u00a9 2024 Ride the Lion Studios. All rights are reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3026730/1796491005/7992acc05df9439feb4d03e8534f251fd2892b09/1771665999/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771752207","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3026730/1796491005/7992acc05df9439feb4d03e8534f251fd2892b09/1771665999/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771752207","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3026730/1796491005/7992acc05df9439feb4d03e8534f251fd2892b09/1771665999/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771752207","id":257291559,"name":"Nextfest Trailer","thumbnail":"https: